  "details": "We have confirmed that the filtering for “Contact Receiver” is currently set incorrectly.\n\n“Allow Others” should ‘only’ determine whether to treat other players or the world's “Contact Sender” as valid, but currently, it also treats the player's own “Contact Sender” as valid, resulting in a functional overlap with “Allow Self.” This undermines the purpose of having two separate options.\n\nPlease fix this.",
